     "<div><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Heather Rosenfeld</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">heather....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Mar 10, 2021 at 06:42<br>Subject: Web mapping/developer job<br>To:  &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">CRIT-GE...@jiscmail.ac.uk</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Hi critters,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">I&#39;ve\r\n been working for a group at Tufts University that studies \r\ngerrymandering, and we&#39;re looking for someone to join our team on the \r\nweb development/web-mapping side. Maybe this is a good fit for you or a former student? Details <a href=\"https://mggg.org/jobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mggg.org/jobs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465283984000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RFJHcfQ8ayuMgzMo0hkhi\">here</a>.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">A\r\n little additional context/my mini recruitment pitch: The group is \r\nawesome, with a lot of strong feminist voices and feminist perspectives \r\nintegrated into what we do, and it&#39;s a super queer friendly workplace. \r\nThis spring/summer we&#39;re doing a ton of community mapping with states, \r\nvoting rights groups, and civil rights groups to support grassroots \r\ninput into the mess that is redistricting in the US. Feel free to reach out with questions.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">cheers,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Heather</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p align=\"center\">To unsubscribe from the CRIT-GEOG-FORUM list, click the following link:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/cgi-bin/WA-JISC.exe?SUBED1=CRIT-GEOG-FORUM&amp;A=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/cgi-bin/WA-JISC.exe?SUBED1%3DCRIT-GEOG-FORUM%26A%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465283984000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10U5xYS1sItwOOIikdoFJa\">https://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/cgi-bin/WA-JISC.exe?SUBED1=CRIT-GEOG-FORUM&amp;A=1</a>\r\n</p>\r\n</div></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr